Cell["XMLPattern::constraint: \"AttributeReadings\" -> <|\"rel\" -> <||>|> is not a constraint. The constraints on what is below an element are the arguments of the bracket after XMLPattern[tag, attrs], as in XMLPattern[tag, attrs][c1, c2, ...]: Child[p] for some element child that matches p, a list pattern over its element children, as in {p} for an only child, or Descendant[p] for an element anywhere below. Attribute constraints go in the first bracket, several in one list: XMLPattern[tag, {a1, a2, ...}].", "Message", "MSG"],

